<p>Enhance your Deadly Poison with a stoning agent.  Whenever you apply Deadly Poison, you afflict your target with an additional earth-based poison that inflicts <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">12, 14, 15, 16, 16</acronym> nature damage per turn (stacking up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">51, 56, 61, 64, 67</acronym> damage per turn) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 6, 7, 7, 8</acronym> turns.</p><p>After either <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9, 6, 4, 4, 3</acronym> turns or the poison has run its course (&lt;100% chance, see effect description), the target will be turned to stone for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage scales with your Cunning.</p>